# Validation protocol TC-01…TC-16 as IntelliJ HTTP Client requests, one per step.
# Run against `docker compose up --build`. Steps and expected outcomes: test-specification.md §5.2;
# results are recorded in .changes/CR-001_product-aggregator.md § Validation.
# "D" = deterministic mode (four requests below), "R" = reset; after a step that opened a circuit,
# `docker compose restart aggregator` (circuit breakers live in the aggregator).

@agg = http://localhost:8080
@mocks = http://localhost:8081

### D — deterministic mode: catalog
PUT {{mocks}}/chaos/catalog
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "FLAKY", "reliability": 1.0}

### D — deterministic mode: pricing
PUT {{mocks}}/chaos/pricing
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "FLAKY", "reliability": 1.0}

### D — deterministic mode: availability
PUT {{mocks}}/chaos/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "FLAKY", "reliability": 1.0}

### D — deterministic mode: customer
PUT {{mocks}}/chaos/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "FLAKY", "reliability": 1.0}

### R — reset every mock to HEALTHY
DELETE {{mocks}}/chaos

### Chaos state of every mock
GET {{mocks}}/chaos

### TC-01 Customer in Poland (D)
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=pl-PL
X-Customer-Id: C-1002

### TC-02 No customer (D)
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=pl-PL

### TC-03 Another market (D)
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=de-AT

### TC-04 Language fallback (D)
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/TS19100KR?market=nl-BE

### TC-05 Outside assortment (R)
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/10112PB?market=pl-PL

### TC-06 Unknown product
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/NOPE123?market=pl-PL

### TC-07 Unsupported market
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=xx-XX

### TC-07 Market code normalised
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=PL_pl

### TC-08 Pricing starts timing out — step 1 (after D): Pricing in TIMEOUT mode
PUT {{mocks}}/chaos/pricing
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "TIMEOUT"}

### TC-08 step 2: send 20 times, watch pricing.status, meta.sources.pricing and the response time
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=pl-PL
X-Customer-Id: C-1002

### TC-08 step 3: reset the mocks, run D again, wait 11 s
DELETE {{mocks}}/chaos

### TC-08 step 4 (after D and 11 s): send 5 times
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=pl-PL
X-Customer-Id: C-1002

### TC-09 Availability down (R, D)
PUT {{mocks}}/chaos/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "DOWN"}

### TC-09 request
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=pl-PL
X-Customer-Id: C-1002

### TC-10 Customer down (R, D)
PUT {{mocks}}/chaos/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "DOWN"}

### TC-10 request
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=pl-PL
X-Customer-Id: C-1002

### TC-11a Catalog down (R, D)
PUT {{mocks}}/chaos/catalog
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "DOWN"}

### TC-11a request: send 7 times, watch the status and Retry-After
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=pl-PL
X-Customer-Id: C-1002

### TC-11b Catalog slow (restart the aggregator, D)
PUT {{mocks}}/chaos/catalog
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "TIMEOUT"}

### TC-11b request
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=pl-PL
X-Customer-Id: C-1002

### TC-12 All optional sources hang (R, D): pricing
PUT {{mocks}}/chaos/pricing
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "TIMEOUT"}

