X-Customer-Id: C-1002

### TC-13 Correlation and logs (D); then `docker compose logs aggregator | grep tc13-abc`
GET {{agg}}/api/v1/products/W6103?market=pl-PL
X-Customer-Id: C-1002
X-Correlation-Id: tc13-abc

### TC-14 gRPC
GRPC localhost:9090/kramp.aggregator.v1.ProductAggregator/GetProduct

{"product_id": "W6103", "market": "pl-PL", "customer_id": "C-1002"}

